    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like i can just \"take a breath\" or whatever. the truth is there's no real way out of this cycle. the more i struggle, the deeper the hole gets. i look at my life and i just see a massive mistake that keeps getting more expensive and more exhausting every day. it feels less like a \"difficult time\" and more like i'm just stuck in a loop that has no logical end point.",
