      "content": "\"let go of the struggle entirely\"... what does that even mean? i feel like i've already let go of everything else. there isn't anyone to take care of me, and there's no help that can just make the debt or the failure go away. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually \"let go\" is to just... stop. stop trying to fix it, stop being a burden, stop existing in it. is that even a real option? or am i just crazy for thinking that stopping would be easier than this?",
